  "summary": "PDF Version First quarter 2026 earnings per share of $1.50, representing a 13% increase year-over-year Increased the full-year 2026 earnings per share growth guidance range to 5% – 15%, up from the prior guidance of 0% – 12% Acquired 23 barges—including five specialty barges and three high horsepower boats—from an undisclosed seller for $95.8 million […]",
